        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo yalobolwa abe omuruchi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yali nalimwo omusaatsa omuBenyamini owa eliiralie niye Kishi, waAbieli waZerori waBekoratsi waAfia, omuBenyamini, omusaatsa wamaani omuyinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yali nende omwanawe omusiani oweliira mbu Saulo, omusooliili omukaasu; mubaIsirael shiyalimwo oundi omukaasu oumushila ta; abandi bosi bamuhelelanga khumabeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne tsisishili tsiaKishi, samwana Saulo, tsiali nitsiakorile. Naye Kishi namusunjila Saulo omwanawe ari Bulaano obukule mulala khubaklholi ninawe, murule mutsie okhukhaaba tsisishili etsio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho yabira mushialo shiebikulu shiaEfuraimu, nabira mushialo shiaShalisha, nibaratsinyoola tawe; mana nibabira mushialo shiaShaalimu, ne tsiali nitsibulayo; nabira mushialo shiabaBenyamini, nibaratsinyoola tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa bali niboolile mushialo shiaZufu, Saulo yasunjila omukholiwe owa yali ninaey, ari Chenda khukalushe; okhuba papa yakhalekha aketsisishili nakhuhendela ifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukholi oyo namukalusia mbu Lola, aliho mwitaala lino omundu waNyasaye, ne nomundu ouheebungwa oluyali; aka aboolanga kosi kamalanga keekhole; kho bulaano khutsieyo; haundi yakhanyala okhukhuboolela akoluchendo Iweefwe olwa khulikhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Saulo nareeba omukholiwe ari Ne lola, nikhuba nikhutsia, nishiina eshia khulamuyilila omundu oyo? Okhuba omukaate kuhweele mubichinjilo bieefwe, ne shishilikhwoho eshihaanwa shiosi eshia khwakhayilila omundu waNyasaye tawe; ne khukhalikhwo nende shiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukholi oyo namukalusia Saulo khandi, nasunga ari Lola, endikhwo nende ifeetsa eyichelwa eshitonye shiakhane shieishekeli hano; shiene-shio nemuheelesie omundu waNyasaye, akhuboolele akeinjila yeefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Mundaalo tsiakhale, muIsiraeli, olwa omundu yalinji niyeenya okhutsia okhureeba ewaNyasaye, yali nasunganga mbu Chende khutsie ewomulakusi; okhuba oyo owa balanganga mbu Omunabii leelo, khale bamulanganga mbu Omulakusi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Saulo yasunjila omukholiwe ari Oteechile; chenda khutsie. Kho nibatsia mwitaala ewa omundu waNyasaye oyo yali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa bali nibatikulukhanga khushisia okhuula khwitaala, baakaana nabakhaana bandi nibarulanga nibatsia amatsi, nibabareeba bari Omulakusi aliho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo nibabakalusiamwo bari Aliho; lola, ali imbeliwo; okhole bwangu, shichila leelo luno yoola mwitaala; okhuba leelo abandu bali nende omusango habundu ahachinguukhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwakheenjila mwitaala, mulamunyoola habwene nahabwene, narashiatsia habundu ahachinguukhu okhulia ta; okhuba abandu shinabalie tawe okhuula olwa yeetsa, shichila niye ousabilanga omusango ikhabi; kho olunyumakhwo abo abalanjilwe baliitsanga. Iiho bulaano mutikulushe; shichila khushise shino mulamunyoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibatikulukha nibatsia mwitaala; nolwa bali nibeenjilanga mwitaala, lola, Samweli yarula nabukaana ninabo, nali okhutikulukha okhutsia habundu ahachinguukhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI yali niyamufwimbuliile Samweli, niyishili inyanga ndala imbeli Saulo okhumwitsila, namuboolela ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukamba, ahambi khushise shinga shino, nekhurumile omundu ourula mushialo shiaBenyamini, nawe omutsushiililekhwo amafura abe omukhulundu wabandu banje Isiraeli; naye alahonia abandu banje mumukhono kwabaFilisiti; okhuba ndahenjile abandu banje, shichila amalilo kabwe kanzuliile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa Samweli yalola Saulo, OMWAMI yamuboolela mbu Omundu owa ndakhubooleelekhwo ngwoyo! Oyo niye oularuka abandu banje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Saulo nasita ahambi nende Samweli hashilibwa, nasunga ari Nochama, unzibaalile, mbu inzu yomulakusi yili heena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Samweli namukalusia Saulo, nasunga ari Nisie omulakusi; ranjilile imbeli wanje, mutikulushe habundu ahachinguukhu, shichila mwitsa okhulia ninasi leelo; mana mutsuli nekhuseebule, khandi nekhuboolele kosi aka oli ninako mumwoyokwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumakhuwa ketsisishilitsio etsiabeelenje nitsikorile tsindaalo tsitaru tsino, oratsihendela tawe; okhuba tsimalile okhunyoolekha. Ne ebiikombekha biosi muIsiraeli nebiawina? Shibili ebibio, khandi ebiabosi abeinzu yaso? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Saulo nakalusia naboola mbu Nasi shindi omuBenyamini, owomuluyia olutuutu muIsiraeli? Khandi eshilibwa shieefwe shishili eshituutu mubilibwa biosi bioluyia lwaBenyamini? Kho nishiina eshichila niumboolela akafwana kari nanwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli yabukula Saulo nende omukholiwe, nabeenjisia mushisika shiabacheni, nabeekhasia mubwikhalo obukhulundu mu abo abali nibalanjilwe; bali abandu shinga amakhumi kataru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Samweli nasunjila omuteeshi webiliibwa ari Leera omukabo okwa ekhuheele, nikhuboolela mbu Ore elubeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omuteeshi webiliibwa yabukula eshiatakho halala nende isembe, namurenjeshela Saulo. Samweli nasunga mbu Eshibiishilwe shieshino, shireebwe imbeliwo. Olie; shichila shikhubiishiilwe khunduukho indobole, mbu olie nende abo abalanjilwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Saulo yalia nende Samweli inyanga yeneyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa bali nibeeshile okhurula habundu ahachinguukhu nibeenjila mwitaala, bamwalila Saulo obulili khushilama shieinzu, naye nakona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibahachila okhubuukha, ne olwa obukwe bwali nibusheba, Samweli yalanga Saulo ewa yali khushilama shieinzu, ari Buukha, ekhuseebule otsie. Saulo nabuukha, nibarula elwanyi bombi, ye nende Samweli.",
          "type": "text",
